                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more appreciable"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "5b0b07cb-2a46-4fa8-aa3e-a0caa223a887",
                        "entry_id": "324ae2ef-5434-33ff-89fa-e01e526a5734",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most appreciable"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9b6f167a-3383-35f2-9d6a-b48709e5623d",
                        "entry_id": "324ae2ef-5434-33ff-89fa-e01e526a5734",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Both detectable and at least modestly substantial: large enough to be estimated and to be of practical relevance."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "usually"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "441ea433-e691-40dc-b7a7-90dec8a48c9a",
                                "sense_id": "9b6f167a-3383-35f2-9d6a-b48709e5623d",
                                "text": "For many people, the benefits of exercise in improving mood and preventing achiness are appreciable."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3aa862df-e78a-4f1e-99e9-b0cc7bddbbeb",
                                "sense_id": "9b6f167a-3383-35f2-9d6a-b48709e5623d",
                                "text": "A grain of musk will scent a drawer for many years, and still lose nothing appreciable of its original weight."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6b48a422-0731-48f9-868e-2824731f905f",
                                "sense_id": "9b6f167a-3383-35f2-9d6a-b48709e5623d",
                                "text": "For an appreciable time he did not think of rising from his seat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "beac039b-945b-40d5-8c9c-010d04d034aa",
                                "sense_id": "9b6f167a-3383-35f2-9d6a-b48709e5623d",
                                "text": "Anti-freeze has not been found necessary, even in the most severe conditions, since the water is drained out if a locomotive spends any appreciable time out of service and in normal working conditions the coolant is always warm."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ec0a5a22-dd6f-441e-9cec-c4578d75bb8a",
                                "sense_id": "9b6f167a-3383-35f2-9d6a-b48709e5623d",
                                "text": "If NEAsia were a zone of peace, those American forces would be unnecessary and they could be sent home and demobilized, saving the U.S. taxpayer an appreciable sum of money."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce2da7d2-f3af-351e-b21a-0318f93d88b9",
                        "entry_id": "324ae2ef-5434-33ff-89fa-e01e526a5734",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Synonym of detectable."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "sometimes"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bbeb6d4-a63c-4006-8a54-243a04dcc74f",
                                "sense_id": "ce2da7d2-f3af-351e-b21a-0318f93d88b9",
                                "text": "A small hernia was just barely appreciable upon palpation."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
